  <!-- EN:
    <li>terminalHackedMessage->Terminal hacked. {COUNT} / [terminalCount] complete.</li>
    <li>allTerminalsHackedMessage->You've hacked all of the terminals and discovered secret information about [relic_name]! You can now leave.</li>
